index 0000000..67cbc0c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/delay-since-first-attempt-initial-value-3f1c9a7b2e5d8064.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    The ``delay_since_first_attempt`` key of ``statistics`` is now present from
+    the start of each run, with the value ``0`` until a retry delay has occurred.
+    Previously the key was only added after the first attempt's stop check, so
+    code reading ``statistics["delay_since_first_attempt"]`` during the first
+    attempt raised ``KeyError``.
